================================================================================
COMPONENTS AND ORIGINAL CONTRIBUTIONS
================================================================================

The following components represent original contributions by the author:

1. On-chain DLEQ proof verification using Garaga MSM on Starknet
   - Cairo contracts: cairo/src/
   - First commit: 2025-12-04

2. Two-phase unlock mechanism for atomic swap race condition mitigation
   - reveal_secret() + claim_tokens() with GRACE_PERIOD
   - First commit: 2025-12-05

3. BLAKE2s-based DLEQ challenge computation with domain separation
   - cairo/src/blake2s_challenge.cairo
   - First commit: 2025-12-05

4. MoneroVM: Optimistic RandomX execution verification via fraud proofs
   - monero-vm/src/
   - Bisection protocol with ERC20 bond enforcement

5. Rust DLEQ proof generation with Sha256 nonce derivation
   - rust/src/
   - Domain-separated nonce: "DLEQ_NONCE_V1"

